        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Semente. Por algum tempo após nascer, Bulbasaur cresce usando os nutrientes armazenados na semente em suas costas. Ele carrega essa semente desde o nascimento, e ela cresce junto com seu corpo.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Bulbasaur pode evoluir para Ivysaur no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Leech Seed, Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Poison Powder, Sleep Powder, Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Razor Leaf, Sweet Scent</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Double-Edge, Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Power Whip, Synthesis, Worry Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Solar Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Seed Bomb</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Attract, Bind, Body Slam, Bullet Seed, Charm, Confide, Curse, Double Team, Double-Edge, Echoed Voice, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, False Swipe, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Knock Off, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Protect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Venoshock, Weather Ball, Work Up, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Charm, Curse, Endure, Giga Drain, Grass Whistle, Grassy Terrain, Ingrain, Leaf Storm, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Petal Dance, Power Whip, Skull Bash, Sludge, Toxic</p>",
